From 51f66dc0dfb734a18e466c2c65ae34ef45451a6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 07:54:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/35] GENIO: media: platform: mtk-mdp3: add kernel algorithm 
 for MT8195 HDMI-RX

Convert the mt8195 MDP3 HDMI-RX functionality to use kernel-side algorithms
to eliminate the dependency on SCP.
Add the config related to the HDMI-RX flow and RGB-to-YUV conversion.

Change-Id: I9c9de70e1d5c445fff2ba9bb24394a5c2be4e594
Signed-off-by: Moudy Ho <moudy.ho@mediatek.com>
